    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d461-a2">

                <pb facs="0636" n="540" sameAs="frus:frus1921v02/pg540"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 2]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Phillips</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Netherlands Minister for Foreign Affairs</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Van Karnebeek</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >The Hague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-04-25"><hi rendition="#italic">April 25,
                        1921</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 153</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: Referring to my Note No. 151, of
                    April 19th last,<anchor n="21" xml:id="d461-f1"/> and to my informal
                    communication of April 22d, on the subject of the participation of American
                    capital in the development of oil in the Netherlands Indies, I have the honor to
                    inform Your Excellency that I have just received a further telegraphic
                    Instruction from the Secretary of State advising me that in view of the wide
                    publicity which the matter of the Djambi concession is receiving in the United
                    States, the practically complete exclusion of American interests from the Dutch
                    oil industry would create an unfavorable impression and a situation of general
                    discouragement to prospective American participants in other branches of Dutch
                    industry.</p>
                <p>In communicating the foregoing to Your Excellency, I avail myself [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d461-f1" n="21" xml:id="d461-f1-content">
                <p>See telegram no. 49, Apr. 25, from the Minister in the Netherlands, <ref
                        target="#pg536">p. 536</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
